I definitions.inc

# merge 决策分支5：两边把同一文件改成不同内容，冲突但仍生成 merge commit
> init
<<<
+ conf.txt mbase.txt
> add conf.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<
> branch other
<<<

# current 侧改成 current side
+ conf.txt mconf-c.txt
> add conf.txt
<<<
> commit "current edit"
<<<

# given 侧改成 given side
> checkout other
<<<
+ conf.txt mconf-g.txt
> add conf.txt
<<<
> commit "given edit"
<<<

> checkout master
<<<
> merge other
Encountered a merge conflict.
<<<

# 冲突文件逐字节等于手写的五段期望
= conf.txt mexpect-both.txt

# merge commit 照常生成：带 Merge 行，消息逐字
> log
===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
Merged other into master.

===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
current edit

===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
base

===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
initial commit

<<<*
